      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹4.61 (vs ₹4.07 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.61 (up from ₹4.07 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.76b (up 56% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹632.4m (up 67% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 23% (up from 21% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 30% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 15% growth forecast for the Retail Distributors industry in Asia.",
